{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BzCUaoSDl2GIEXcPgAPbhA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:17.999082+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BzCUaoSDl2GIEXcPgAPbhA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/aBto1iajIj0g6y1pC54Z5U41MToicvicp98FMcVKHaibiaibuv4X8GJ7Aq2sNYicXeX4k5p73WTLW73jWkz9QcKOVHt5Q/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9dMGkDOwAqYNFiaYGmYxUL1x60knQXEeVDLcmhBibvlRHAtJngyCONZxw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9AvOu1NFXKxO48pPC7vbWSibibmZJdxA1Pz6o2rqhQdpB1xyCKeOzD8vg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9y3Sp5kV5pOjorzHV9O9EtHGQyhSYtSeDPg7fIibIezoROUpiaXfY4Apw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9y7picicsUUyr5tGnwqIpAJpibSu2CEBRHLOs7FTUgibeQpu2fpceONSLFg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9NOZVlIKVCBCsV6G8UmLBFpNG1Z6piasXIDNqcnlibLU9VZZtnNyFChAQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ90tNBxjcrFDnnTzsGQn3ISwkWGmiaLbqJxUd6U32eVLR4fH71xglwB0A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9emEM0NcXqKlibAKwEktRAndib5NnpW2Nfsw6bvMYw2P5XzddVdyCUM9g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9qTtCITMbiclOXtS0vYFwd7siajRdZ0lZIpIdDXBxic0I6by5g9qibGEoOQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>根据学校2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动工作部署，制订本学院具体工作方案并通知如下。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>01、学院概况</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>东南大学生命科学与技术学院起源于1902年成立的三江师范学堂，后历经1905年的两江师范学堂、1914年的南京高等师范学堂、1921年的国立东南大学、1928年的国立中央大学等重要发展时期。1920年成立的中国历史上第一个“生物学系”，即在东南大学四牌楼校区（现中山院）。为大力发展生命学科，东南大学于2009年成立生命科学研究院，2019年撤销研究院建制组建生命科学与技术学院。</span></p><p><span><span>学院设有“生物学”“生物与医药”两个一级学科博士学位点，以及生物学博士后科研流动站；拥有“发育与疾病相关基因”教育部重点实验室、东南大学“果蝇和线虫资源库”、教育部“长江学者奖励计划”特聘教授岗位；形成了包含“神经发育与功能的调控机制”“干细胞的基础与应用”“发育疾病的遗传调控与临床转化”等极具特色的研究方向。以生物学为支撑的临床医学、生物学与生物化学、神经生物学与行为学、药理学与毒理学、免疫学、分子生物学与遗传学等6个学科进入ESI 排名全球前1%。</span></span></p><p><span>生命科学与技术学院招收“生物学”学术型和“生物与医药”专业型研究生（硕、博士）。学院积极创新研究生培养和管理机制，在硕士研究生培养中实行轮转制度。学院还建立了一套全过程培养体系，不断增强研究生培养质量。目前，学院每年招收硕士研究生近100人，博士研究生30余人。近五年来本院研究生在Cell, Nature Cell Biology,Cell Stem Cell,Molecular Cell, Developmental Cell, Science Advances, Nature Communications, PNAS, Current Biology,eLife等权威学术期刊发表多篇高水平研究论文。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>02、申请条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></p><p><span>1.在本科学校可取得推荐免试研究生资格；</span></p><p><span>2.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，无有违学术道德等行为；</span></p><p><span>4.身心健康；</span></p><p><span>5.英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>6.跨专业申请者，需对生物学有浓厚兴趣且本专业成绩优秀；</span></p><p><span>7.申请本科直博者，除满足以上条件外，应热爱科学研究，具有较强的科研创新能力和博士生培养潜质。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>03、申请者报名</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>系统报名要求</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1） 登 录 东 南 大 学 研 究 生 报 考 服 务 系 统</span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>http://gsas.seu.edu.cn，以下简称“系统”），选择“全国优秀大学生夏令营”项目。</span></span></p><p><span>（2）报名时间：2025年7月1日中午12:00 —7月31日中午12:00。</span></p><p><span>（3）申请者只能申请一个志愿，</span><span><span>请务必慎重选择</span></span><span>，如实填写各项信息，信息填写完毕后认真核对，提交后将无法再做更改。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>提交材料要求</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请者在系统中报名时，须线上提交以下材料，且须保证所提交材料的真实性和准确性，若弄虚作假，一经发现，取消申请资格。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aBto1iajIj0iatrJkHX8KyBQ151BiaWhsSlTz2uUmYIjqyDYPIJxs394ay0cQRria233jhfOIz7LWv1XRUJJm7V1qQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>注：上传材料请端正扫描，并去掉各种背景颜色</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>04、审核与确认</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>学院审核</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>报名结束后，学院将从已提交报名信息的申请者中择优筛选,届时将通过学院官网（https://ils.seu.edu.cn）公布入选名单。</span><span><span>请申请者及时关注学院官网发布的入选名单，以免错失机会。未入选者不再另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>入选者确认</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>公布入选名单两天内，学院将通过系统发布具体工作安排，入选者须及时在系统中回复“确认参加”或“确认不参加”，未在规定时间内回复者，将视为自动放弃。</span><span><span>请入选者及时关注系统中的夏令营工作安排，以免错失机会。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>05、其他说明</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.本校应届本科生申请者也须报名参加本院夏令营。</span></p><p><span>2.本校应届本科生拟报名工程硕博士专项、集成电路专项班、国优计划、支教团计划、辅导员计划等推免专项的，须报名参加夏令营（拟跨学院读研的，须报名拟读研学院的夏令营）。</span></p><p><span>3.如遇政策调整，以相关政策规定为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>06、咨询方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人：何老师</span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：103009372@seu.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>来源丨生科学院</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>排版丨李慧敏</span></p><p><span>审核丨何亦橦</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aBto1iajIj0g6y1pC54Z5U41MToicvicp98Eyzicj5q1uY42CQjlwBrf54IoyBvgA0Dz131cbW8DL1eSKtaFQGKKgw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2d6276247427b632eb3722f3ab18f1112738fe0ca3c91e4da39af6064c7e3889","textLength":1648,"sourceSha256":"e1f3f33f0eab1aab57f7d5da55211ef65d2f3ab17357c4941b3b5ff0ab10cde1","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7d994c5f410c3b82e4a0","title":"2025年东南大学生命科学与技术学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:17.999082+00:00"}
